WEBVTT

00:07.520 --> 00:08.920
Someone

00:10.200 --> 00:11.600
Order the entire army

00:12.560 --> 00:14.000
Continue retreating

00:15.500 --> 00:28.500
You ordered your army to fall back another thirty li. Prince Ning Sikong Zheng opened the city gates, but it was the imperial capital garrison launching a surprise assault upon the Beishuo army. Simultaneously, the Qingzhou Army arrived from the rear, trapping you in a pincer attack.
